   payload     : 7 attribute(s), NULL-PADDED TO THE SATELLITE
   grain       : ONE ROW PER HUB_ORG_UNIT_HK
   hashdiff    : SAT_ORG_UNIT_DEFINITION_HASHDIFF (builder decision BD1), GUARDED against an all-null input (s5.5):
                 without the guard every all-null row hashes to ONE value and the
