     ZONE_NAME                              opus_health_legacy_v4  2 writer(s), of which 2 UNDISCRIMINATED (0 separated by a resolved instance, 0 by redundant_of)  [CROSS-TABLE: check_collapse groups on (table, satellite, attribute, instance, child_key) and CANNOT see this]
